{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1505731-strange-redcape","id":1505731,"title":"Strange Redcape","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-03-18T17:50:59-07:00","id":1505731,"title":"Strange Redcape","content":"To be honest, I just started to learn about Changeling recently, I don't know if I'm going to play, but I have an acquaintance who plays or has played, and he told me a curious case of a Redcape who works in a day care center taking care of children, I can I'm being a little judgmental, but I think this is a little weird, interesting, but weird, is it just me who sees something out of place?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-18T18:24:39-07:00","id":1505738,"title":"","content":"If they're one of the few Seelie Redcaps, it's completely in-keeping with how they tend to be. It's a lot more strange for an Unseelie one for sure.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-18T18:39:10-07:00","id":1505739,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1505731-strange-redcape?p=1505738#post1505738\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If they're one of the few Seelie Redcaps, it's completely in-keeping with how they tend to be. It's a lot more strange for an Unseelie one for sure.</div> </div> </div> </div>I know about the courts, but only superficially, now I don't know about what court this one is. Anyway what I read and heard about them they seem to wild for this type of do i guess..","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-19T01:23:37-07:00","id":1505767,"title":"","content":"You never saw a scary old woman working at a daycare center, aggressively confronting a stranger who walks in unexpectedly while children whisper rumours about the time she ate a cat?<br /> <br /> Unless you're a hunter you will not believe the children's stories because the ones who are telling the truth literally believe she is an inhuman monster. As for her temperament, she's at her worst when protecting the children from people who might be credible threats, so it's hard to object to that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13395-daniel-knight","name":"Daniel Knight","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"96"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-19T06:10:32-07:00","id":1505776,"title":"","content":"Daniel Knight has a point. Remember children are very tolerant of monsters that protect them. When the TV show <b>Benson </b>was in first run the character of Gretchen Krause got tons of fan mail. Vast numbers of children told her she was the meanest person ever, told her they loved her, and asked her to live with them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-19T07:38:55-07:00","id":1505779,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Daniel Knight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1505731-strange-redcape?p=1505767#post1505767\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You never saw a scary old woman working at a daycare center, aggressively confronting a stranger who walks in unexpectedly while children whisper rumours about the time she ate a cat?<br /> <br /> Unless you're a hunter you will not believe the children's stories because the ones who are telling the truth literally believe she is an inhuman monster. As for her temperament, she's at her worst when protecting the children from people who might be credible threats, so it's hard to object to that.</div> </div> </div> </div>Look, around here where I live the closest thing to that is an old woman who hates the world, but I liked that idea anyway.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-19T10:44:24-07:00","id":1505796,"title":"","content":"Another take on a similar concept would be a changeling who went through the Forgetting from the Banality dealt with from parents and administrators at the daycare, and eventually becoming an Autumn Person.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10243-zenten","name":"zenten","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10243_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"488"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}